---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {finance} from '../data/storefront';
export const prerender=true;
---
<Layout title="Trailer finance"><section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Finance</span></div><p class="eyebrow">PLAN YOUR PURCHASE</p><h1>Your trailer.<br/>Your next step.</h1><p>Start with a confirmed trailer and written quote before making payment or finance arrangements.</p><div class="hero-buttons" style="margin-top:25px"><a class="button" href="/quote/?topic=finance">Request a trailer quote →</a><a class="button outline" href="#finance-options">Explore your options</a></div></div></section><section class="section wrap" id="finance-options"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FINANCE INFORMATION</p><h2>Prepare before you apply.</h2></div><p class="section-description">The trailer purchase and any finance application are separate arrangements.</p></div><div class="content-grid"><article class="support-card"><p class="eyebrow">01 / YOUR TRAILER</p><h2>Confirm the configuration</h2><p>Choose a trailer layout, record the options and confirm the total purchase price, availability and collection details.</p><a class="text-link" href="/shop/">Choose a trailer →</a></article><article class="support-card"><p class="eyebrow">02 / YOUR FINANCE</p><h2>Review a provider’s terms</h2><p>Use the confirmed written quote when discussing your requirements with a finance provider.</p>{finance.applicationUrl?<a class="button" href={finance.applicationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit finance application →</a>:<p class="notice">An online finance application is not currently available through this website.</p>}{finance.calculatorUrl&&<a class="text-link" href={finance.calculatorUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open repayment calculator →</a>}</article></div></section><section class="range-section"><div class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">FROM QUOTE TO COLLECTION</p><h2>Keep each step clear.</h2><div class="support-grid"><article class="support-card"><h3>1. Choose</h3><p>Identify the trailer, intended load and required equipment.</p></article><article class="support-card"><h3>2. Confirm</h3><p>Review the specification, itemised quote and fulfilment arrangements.</p></article><article class="support-card"><h3>3. Arrange</h3><p>Finalise payment and any separately arranged finance before collection.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section wrap content-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">QUESTIONS BEFORE PURCHASE</p><h2>Know what to confirm.</h2><p style="margin-top:22px">Keep your trailer quote and purchase information together when reviewing payment options.</p></div><div><details><summary>Can I reserve a trailer by asking about finance?</summary><p>An enquiry does not reserve a trailer. Confirm the order and reservation arrangements in writing.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I check the trailer price?</summary><p>Approved pricing is shown on eligible products. For a quote-only design, request an itemised quote for your chosen configuration.</p></details><details><summary>Can I purchase for a business or fleet?</summary><p>Include your business, quantities, locations and required dates in a structured enquiry.</p><a class="text-link" href="/bulk-orders/">Business & fleet enquiries →</a></details></div></section></Layout>
